        "answer": {
          "short": "$7$",
          "worked": "$$14w+21=7(2w+3)$$\nThe unknown measurement is the area divided by the known side:\n$$\\frac{7(2w+3)}{2w+3}=7$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 25
